// Benchmark 7 (`docs/rfc.md` §7.8): Ratification and versioned `Amend` across law versions with reflexive ratchet.
//! explore: 1
Fact senate Identified by S1.
Fact citizen Identified by Cit1.
Fact supermajority Identified by senate.
Fact timelock-passed Identified by senate.
Fact exited Identified by citizen.
Fact tax-active Identified by citizen.

Power exercise-exit Actor citizen
  Holds when True
  Valid when True
  Creates exited(citizen).

Power levy-tax Actor senate Recipient citizen
  Holds when True
  Valid when True
  Creates tax-active(citizen).

Entrenched Invariant exit-entrenched When True.

Immunity exit-ratchet Holder citizen
  Against Amend
  Protects exercise-exit
  Holds when True.

Amend repeal-tax Actor senate
  Repeals levy-tax
  Holds when supermajority(senate)
  Valid when supermajority(senate) && timelock-passed(senate).

Amend repeal-exit Actor senate
  Repeals exercise-exit
  Holds when supermajority(senate)
  Valid when supermajority(senate) && timelock-passed(senate).

+supermajority(S1).
+timelock-passed(S1).

Scenario non-protected-amended-while-entrenched-ratchet-holds {
  ?valid repeal-tax(S1).
  repeal-tax(S1).
  ?!valid levy-tax(S1, Cit1).
  ?!valid repeal-exit(S1).
  repeal-exit(S1).
  ?valid exercise-exit(Cit1).
}
